From b2e0882fefe910ad2ef0a4a4d926dd27905d7c8a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Romain Dolbeau <romain@dolbeau.org>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 18:23:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] hw/misc: add virt-smp, an SMP controller for the m68k
 virt machine

Add a paravirtual SMP controller for the m68k virt machine: CPU
identification, secondary CPU start/stop, inter-processor interrupts, a
timer per CPU, a global nanosecond counter, and per-CPU interrupt
priority logic with routing of the device interrupt levels to a CPU.
The programming model is in docs/specs/virt-smp.rst.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Romain Dolbeau <romain@dolbeau.org>
